{
  "id": 8879779348679,
  "title": "Pamnest Twin Halloween Comforter Set with Sheets, 5 Pieces - Design 05",
  "handle": "pamnest-twin-halloween-comforter-set-with-sheets-5-pieces-design-05",
  "body_html": "<p>Experience ultimate comfort and style with the Jeminise Twin Halloween Comforter Set. This 5-piece bedding ensemble is designed to add a touch of fashion and coziness to your sleeping space, ensuring a peaceful night's sleep with its premium, finely brushed microfiber filling.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Filled with premium, finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one comforter (68\" x 90\"), one flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), one fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exquisite Design:</strong> Features stylish and exquisite patterns with durable stitching that prevents filling from shifting or clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Fit:</strong> The deep-pocket fitted sheet includes an elastic band on all four sides, accommodating mattresses up to 14 inches thick for a secure fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low; designed to withstand years of use without weakening or tearing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Selected Design:</strong> Features a fun Halloween theme with Pumpkin, Ghost, and Bats patterns.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for all seasons, including Fall, Summer, and Winter.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Pumpkin, Ghost, Bats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Horror Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 x Comforter &amp; 1 x Pillowcase &amp; 1 x Pillow Sham &amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet &amp; 1 x Flat Sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Item Dimensions</th>\n<td>90 x 68 x 1 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fitted Sheet Depth</th>\n<td>14 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Fall, Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</table>",
